#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:5
#: 577b2d4c9b644baf97ca6132298c6694
msgid "Using an External Compass with APM 2.x"
msgstr "在 APM 2.x 上使用外置罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:9
#: 2c3ce86e295f49fc97ea5c757e4df6dd
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:11
#: 8695c41f8eb94df6a373d33a4913f4e1
msgid ""
"The APM2.x is end of life for use with ArduPilot. This article is made "
"available for existing users."
msgstr "APM2.x 已停止支持 ArduPilot。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:14
#: 8896fee747394ad796238a2e12d38aee
msgid ""
"If you're having trouble with magnetic noise affecting your compass onboard "
"the APM 2.5 board, you may want to switch to an external compass that you "
"can mount further away from noise sources such as motors. This article "
"explains how."
msgstr ""
"如果您在使用 APM 2.5 飞控板时遇到磁噪声干扰罗盘的问题，可以考虑改用外置罗盘，将其安装在远离电机等噪声源的位置。本文介绍具体操作方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:23
#: a30b636b3ab24c19be004d0a0a8d45a1
msgid "Step-by-step instructions"
msgstr "分步说明"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:25
#: 2c6ad2553d3748efb70fbe73d5ce05cd
msgid ""
"Purchase a `HMC5883L magnetometer breakout board "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/APM2_6_Compass_HMC5883_p/jdmagnet001.htm>`__. Make"
" sure the 3DR board is set to use 3.3volts (the APM 2.5’s I2C port uses 3.3 "
"volts, not 5 volts). You will have to modify the 3DR board because it is "
"shipped from 3DR with the 5 volt jumper set, as shown below."
msgstr ""
"购买一块 `HMC5883L 磁力计扩展板 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/APM2_6_Compass_HMC5883_p/jdmagnet001.htm>`__。请确保 "
"3DR 板设置为使用 3.3V（APM 2.5 的 I2C 接口使用 3.3V，而非 5V）。由于 3DR 板出厂时跳线设置为 "
"5V，如下图所示，您需要对其进行修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:34
#: 09d5e15ddcc347efba4397ee27821e2b
msgid ""
"Looking at the below picture, cut the jumper trace in the middle of the APM "
"2.5 board. This disables the SDA line to the board’s internal compass, "
"rendering it inert."
msgstr "参照下图，切断 APM 2.5 板中间的跳线焊盘。这将禁用连接到板载罗盘 SDA 线，使其失效。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:41
#: d815c716a9fb4c988d31f223da3a1f66
msgid ""
"The APM 2.5 I2C connector needs a 4 pin DF13 connector (like `this one "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_4pin_15cm_p/cbldf13p4c15.htm>`__). Cut "
"off one and and strip and tin the four wires."
msgstr ""
"APM 2.5 I2C 接口需要一根 4 针 DF13 连接器（如 `这款 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_4pin_15cm_p/cbldf13p4c15.htm>`__）。剪去一端并剥开、上锡四根导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:43
#: 09f268fdc18d4e4f9ca839417616f4e0
msgid ""
"Connect the DF13’s 4 wires to the compass breakout board. Note that the "
"wires will not be one to one. Pin 1 on the DF13 connector will not go to pin"
" 1 of the compass board. The standard 3DR cable has one red wire and three "
"black wires. Substitute your wire colors accordingly. Solder the wires as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"将 DF13 的 4 根导线连接到罗盘扩展板。注意导线并非一一对应。DF13 连接器的第 1 针不对应罗盘板的第 1 针。标准 3DR "
"线缆有一根红线和三根黑线，请根据您的线缆颜色相应替换。按如下方式焊接导线："

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:49
#: bc0be1134e374415bf04790b6cd5b187
msgid ""
"Red wire on end of connector (+3.3v) goes to the VCC (or +3.3v) pad on the "
"compass board (see labels on board for location). This is the wire closest "
"to the interior on the APM 2.5 board."
msgstr "连接器末端的红线（+3.3V）接罗盘板上的 VCC（或 +3.3V）焊盘（参见板上标注的位置）。这是 APM 2.5 板内侧最近的导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:52
#: c600e6e374974cb883bc28e47dc6912d
msgid "Wire next to red wire (SCL) goes to the SCL pad on the compass board."
msgstr "红线旁边的导线（SCL）接罗盘板上的 SCL 焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:54
#: 6dd713e1de8f4ef982db63729ff1719f
msgid ""
"Wire next to wire next to red wire (SDA) goes to the SDA pad on compass "
"board."
msgstr "红线旁边再旁边的导线（SDA）接罗盘板上的 SDA 焊盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:56
#: 1268df9a862048519c91e8e183ceadfb
msgid ""
"Black wire on end of connector (ground) goes to ground pad on compass board."
" This is the wire closest to the edge of the APM 2.5 board."
msgstr "连接器末端的黑线（地线）接罗盘板上的地线焊盘。这是 APM 2.5 板边缘最近的导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:60
#: 74259f7122494963a8dbde911be829dd
msgid ""
"Mount the compass board on the top plate of your quad. Double-sided foam "
"tape works well for this. The orientation of the board matters. In the "
"picture below, we've mounted the board “components up with pins forward”. "
"Note which direction you mount the board – you will need to modify the "
"software with this orientation, as explained in the next step."
msgstr ""
"将罗盘板安装在四轴飞行器的顶板上。双面泡棉胶带效果良好。板的方向很重要。在下图中，我们以「元器件朝上，引脚朝前」的方式安装了该板——请记录您安装板的方向，因为您需要在软件中设置此方向，如下一步所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:70
#: 5ec336d36e8340ffbc84e04f0c9b5676
msgid ""
"Modify, compile and load the software for your compass board orientation. "
"You must be able to load software from the Arduino IDE to complete this "
"step. In “APM_Config.h”, you will find a commented out statement like:"
msgstr ""
"根据您的罗盘板方向修改、编译并上传软件。您必须能够从 Arduino IDE "
"上传软件才能完成此步骤。在「APM_Config.h」中，您会找到类似如下的注释语句："

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:79
#: 09f686b942b645bfbb17d2b8ded1da23
msgid ""
"For the orientation shown in the picture above, for example, you would add "
"the following statement just below the commented out statement above as "
"follows:"
msgstr "例如，对于上图所示的方向，您需要在上述注释语句下方添加以下语句："

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:88
#: dca5e8ca9ee749548a84b625dfe3f1a7
msgid ""
"You can find a list of all possible orientations for the ``MAG_ORIENTATION``"
" flag in the **AP_Compass_HMC5843.h** library, including orientations for "
"both the 3DR and Sparkfun boards."
msgstr ""
"您可以在 **AP_Compass_HMC5843.h** 库中找到 ``MAG_ORIENTATION`` 标志的所有可能方向列表，包括 3DR 板和"
" Sparkfun 板的方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:92
#: 605357f7b6cb4b9fb530db2e14342101
msgid ""
"If this is the first time loading software from the IDE, make sure the "
"following statement is uncommented:"
msgstr "如果这是第一次从 IDE 上传软件，请确保以下语句未被注释："

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:99
#: f5150fba6ff64af7acb4c2dcd662ea55
msgid "Save, Compile and Upload the modified software"
msgstr "保存、编译并上传修改后的软件"

#: ../../source/docs/externalmagentometer-apm2x.rst:100
#: 5056c0ad20b5462b8795b1fdabcef27d
msgid "Test the compass board and have fun flying with a now stable compass!"
msgstr "测试罗盘板，享受配备稳定罗盘的飞行乐趣！"

